### auto-process API requests
### Install the "REST Client" VS Code extension (humao.rest-client), then
### click "Send Request" above any block below. Server must be running
### (npm run start:dev) and the local DB up (npx prisma dev ls).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Root (sanity check — always "Hello World!")
GET {{baseUrl}}/


### ============ Product ============

### Create Product
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Keyboard",
  "price": 49,
  "description": "Mechanical keyboard",
  "inStock": true
}

### List Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Get Product by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### Update Product
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 39
}

### Delete Product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/1


